# Java cognitive complexity verification

## Requirement

Apply the corporate cognitive complexity policy to Java methods with a documented analyzer and language-specific counting behavior.

## Verification

Record per-method scores, tool version, threshold and exceptions. The approved per-method maximum is **15**. Findings above this value MUST fail the applicable QA Gate unless a documented exception has been approved.
